Tester 49306, pair 182137 (conv 48521), first goal still working:
„სანტექნიკოსი … გამდის. ჰკითხე X-ს და Y-ს." was bound to the open goal as
a repeat. The repeat wall refused search_contact_by_name twice, the repeat
note told the run to ask what the owner meant, and the owner got
„ეს სწორად გავიგე?" instead of the two asks.

A line that orders asking people it names stays bound to the open goal
(no second goal), but it is not walled or noted as a repeat, so the run
looks the people up and asks them.

DONE WHEN: 3928 run 2 on 2 fresh pairs, where both named people are asked
and the owner is told who it went to.

